            <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34f707687d1b49b567b&quot;,&quot;022df038-06e0-8b0d-c2af-31563258d2d0&quot;],[]]]" class="mission-list">
              <div to-top-2="" class="mission-list-item">
                <h3 class="mission-title">Our Mission</h3>
                <p class="paragraph-regular mission-sumary">To give every woman and family calm, expert care from the first fertility question to the newborn weeks, with doctors who listen closely, explain every option clearly and build a plan that truly fits their body, their values and their daily life.</p>
              </div>
              <div to-top-2="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34f707687d1b49b567b&quot;,&quot;3938cded-e4ea-95e8-f5e2-8e96a1fd5577&quot;],[]]]" class="mission-list-item">
                <h3 class="mission-title">Our Vision</h3>
                <p class="paragraph-regular mission-sumary">To be the clinic families trust most for women’s health, where advanced fertility, pregnancy and hormone care sit under one roof, waiting times stay short and every patient leaves feeling heard, informed and confident about the next step ahead.</p>
              </div>
              <div to-top-2="" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d34f707687d1b49b567b&quot;,&quot;6466757c-47ba-3ed3-de7e-b91d5b768faf&quot;],[]]]" class="mission-list-item">
                <h3 class="mission-title">Our Strategy</h3>
                <p class="paragraph-regular mission-sumary">We pair board-certified specialists with an in-house lab, same-week appointments and secure video visits, so tests, results and treatment move quickly. Each patient keeps one care team, and we follow up after every visit to keep progress on track.</p>
              </div>
